{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-13_beg",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-13",
  "title": "落雪，浸黑國土",
  "storyCode": "R8-11",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-13_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c20906ae39bcf991673ce00c37b6065bbcedff69ed51d6283d9294e5c78dc86e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "暉潔：\n雪沒有化。春天沒有來。\n這個春天彷彿怎麼都不會來。\n每當抬頭看見燭火，就不禁伸出手把它掐滅，卻又不得不在黑暗中重新點燃它。\n快過去吧，冬天。再不過去，我們就都要被這場雪埋住了。\n快點過去吧。\n2月21日"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "塔露拉，你怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "這幾個月你消沉了好多。發生什麼事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "沒什麼......沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "我跟你們的時間不長，但按他們說的，以前的你......會不會活潑點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "喂。她沒架子這點本來就很難得了。你剛這些話，你去對大尉說說？別太過分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "那我不敢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "愛國者先生沒他說的那麼可怕。盾衛都這樣，別往心裡去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "只不過他最近嗓子不太好，說的話少了些吧......給了你們一點無聲的壓力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "至於我的狀態......別擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "嗯......只是想得比較多。我們的隊伍離烏薩斯城市群越來越近，很多事也需要進一步的討論，我會想得比較多一些才會給你這種感覺吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "是啊，缺水少糧的，人手真不夠用，再這樣下去我們要耗不起了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "是的，所以，我們必須更加注意外部各勢力的動向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "一方面是，我們要儘快聯繫上本地的感染者聚落和團體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "另一方面，肯定有人會嘗試捕捉我們的行蹤......如果一個不小心落入圈套，所有人就都要和雪原告別了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "聽起來很糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "當然很糟。不過只要我們縝密地規劃接下來的路線，我們就不會走到那一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "......所以，減少損失才是當務之急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "也許將我們的隊伍分散開來會讓我們的行動更隱蔽些，但這樣一來通信就成了問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "啊，是啊，那些搶來的烏薩斯的通訊設備，我們用不了，我們弄不到他們的發報設備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "這會讓我們的聯絡員和偵察員陷入不必要的危險之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "遊擊隊密語的學習成本太高了，想配發一整套聯絡設備，我們就必須拿到原型機......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊隊員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "text": "塔露拉......塔露拉！偵察員遇襲了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "這種小事，自己解決就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊隊員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "text": "別吵，和以前不是一回事！連敵人是誰我們都沒摸到，他就倒下去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊隊員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "text": "直接找到然後準確地襲擊了我們的偵察術師，這可不是什麼普通感染者糾察隊能做到的......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "事關戰友性命的事，沒有小事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "雪怪，帶我去事發地點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "盾衛，我們也許遭遇了烏薩斯某個集團軍的下屬部隊。跟我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "記住，即使是先遣軍也要萬分小心，一旦處理不當，就會引來大規模的報復。一定要避免這種事的發生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "傳令兵，去通知愛國者先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊隊員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "text": "去叫霜星大姊——嗚！哦，咳......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "孔德拉沙！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "雪怪小弟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊隊員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "text": "啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "啊......！什麼？！快，快把他放下來！把該死的槍拔出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "（......黑色的長矛從他身上......長了出來？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "（不會，不會......怎麼會在這？！帝國豢養的孽物怎麼會在這？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "唔，呃......呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "裝神弄鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "天殺的沒娘養的東西！上，剁了他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "別去......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "你幹什麼？你攔我幹什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "你不知道我們......你不知道我們遇上了什麼！你連他是什麼都不知道還想上去送命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘶......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "你怕個屁？！我們人這麼多！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "（將盾牌狠狠砸入地面）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "呃？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "你想送死？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "......那是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "是**的烏薩斯的皇帝內衛！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "......軍團的盾衛也會自甘墮落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "規勸你們，現在自盡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "各個盾衛，重整陣型！保護其他戰士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "千萬記住，千萬記住！一點缺口都不要給他露！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "恐懼漫溢在空氣裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "你身邊的感染者並沒有準備好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "別害怕！你越怕他，他越會殺你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "他什麼時候都可能動手，睜大眼睛，別移開視線！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "又一次無功而返。應該拔除這三座城市的資訊網。毫無用處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "呃，呃......！你神氣什麼！你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "向當地駐軍投降，或者我割下並帶走你們的口鼻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "割，割......割嘴和鼻子，那不就是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "......巫怪......毀臉巫怪！那不是......那不是故事嗎......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "就是他們？！就是他們嗎？殺了人帶走他們面孔，留下一林子無名屍體？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "他們要活多少年......這傳說可......只......只可能是巫怪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "不，他們不是傳說也不是精怪故事裡的邪魔！他們只是殺手和劊子手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "我們怎麼可能對付得了巫怪？！我們憑什麼和他們鬥，我們只是些人！只是些普通人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "感染者自稱是人......普通人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "呼......呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "......你，你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "救......救......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "不准逃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "一個都不准走！你逃，只會死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "可這東西，這東西不是人！我們怎麼能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "誰逃就殺了誰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "你們的命已經和其他人的命捆在一起了，防線崩潰大家就都得死！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "他們沒你們想的那麼可怕，他們也是肉體凡軀！就算是皇帝內衛也沒法輕易打穿我們這麼幾個盾衛一層又一層的防禦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "......但你們要是害怕了，你們就是他們的突破口，你們就是他們第一個下手的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "同作為烏薩斯的強大武力，盾衛卻選擇與我們對抗，與感染者為伍，愚昧至斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "這個時代的確不幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "他要抽刀了！盾衛們，舉盾！！架住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "嘶......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "......他......沒攻過來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "......焦灼的氣味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "啊......身體暖和起來了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "——難道，難道，是她來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "她來了！來了！放輕鬆，她來了！就算是巫怪也會被她燒成灰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "......別大意！皇帝內衛可不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你想帶走誰的什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你傷害了我們的同胞。你想用暴力解決問題，那我們也用暴力——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "用暴力——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "看見你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "3，7，22，36。 【密語】，【密語】。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "......為什麼烏薩斯的皇帝內衛......會在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "塔露拉......你不該先來。你該讓大尉先趕過來......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "你想知道我們出現在這的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "理由是，我們在找你，公爵的女兒。我們需要評估現狀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雪花落地的聲音清晰可聞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "公爵的女兒。謹記，憑你的身份，你應以更文明的詞彙稱呼我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "......你說誰是誰的女兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "你有妄圖否認的事實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "我怎麼可能是條蛇的女兒？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "憤怒。出自懊惱的憤怒......想要逃避事實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "“皇帝的利刃”......呸！你今天來這裡是想要嘲弄我？還是想要殺掉我？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皇帝內衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "嘶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "——護衛塔露拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "（兄弟們！內衛再厲害也只有一個，有塔露拉做主攻和指揮，我們扛住，只要你們支援上來，我們一定能......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "（......感染者兄弟？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "（公爵的女兒是什麼意思？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "嘶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "你沒有向他們如實宣告你的真實身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "這也是你的計畫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "......什麼......計畫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "你在污辱誰？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "挑撥也要看人，劊子手。所有人共同的事業和我的身份間沒有任何關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "挑撥這個行為只能用以針對信任。你與他們之間存在信任關係一事，存疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "我只能假設，假設......你認定，在他們知道你的身份後，依然會信任你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "一個為烏薩斯帝國暗地裡實施屠殺的蒙面惡棍？這裡沒人需要他來評判。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "你的語言很激烈......也很自信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "如果這也符合你的安排......那麼，我需要重估現下的局勢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "就此告別。請記住，我們與他們有共同點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "對你抱著不信任的態度這點，是我與你身邊人的共通處。即使是一小點我們的信任，你也應該用行為去爭取。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "嘶......你有疑問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你傷害了我的同胞。你知道我們在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "什麼......我是否誤解了你的表達。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你想回去向誰告密？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "哪一個秘密？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "戰士們，我們不能讓他暴露我們的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "(塔露拉，你有信心......打贏內衛嗎？)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "(不這麼做我們只可能損失更多......接連而來的糾察隊甚至是帝國軍人，只會讓我們損失慘重！)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "(皇帝內衛想要對我們的行動做出反應也是需要時間的。)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "(只有迅速控制住面前的敵人，我們才能在撤退與深入兩者間做出選擇。想要有得選，就得當機立斷！)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "而且，儘管我們應當小心，我們卻沒理由畏懼他。他只是恐怖的代言人，而恐怖在對不公的憤怒面前不堪一擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "——對，遊擊隊沒理由害怕這些帝國的殺手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "畏畏縮縮的還算感染者的盾與槍嗎？一個人再怎麼樣也不是團結起來的我們的對手！他只是一個劊子手而已！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "一個人......並不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "你們身後還有一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "塔露拉來時的道路上，現在也矗立著一個身穿大衣的“人”。\n灰蒙天空墜下片片白色，沾上他的風衣的雪片忽然變成黑色，進而碎裂、散落在地，污濁如泥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "有兩個......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "這算什麼？用兩個人堵截我們幾十個人？荒唐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "科西切之女，我們假定你已經做出了這樣一個判斷：他們不會因為你的身份就質疑你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "我們可以驗證一下結果。如果你的判斷是錯誤的，你父親給我們的承諾，全都就此作廢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "什麼東西......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "你還在胡思亂想什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "別發呆了！他們可不只是要塔露拉的命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "......啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "你以為在她死後，你們還能從這兩個殺人狂手裡活下來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "text": "保護塔露拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "不......保護戰士們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "第一步，把他們逼退！第二步，確保撤退路線！第三步，保護好自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "現在這時候繼續深入就不要想了！保存有生力量，保住自己的命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "因為......只有活著才能做些什麼，要是死了就什麼都沒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "活下去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "這和你父親的所言所說截然不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_077",
      "text": "......你也許會讓我們失望，北原感染者的領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "我不是什麼領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "我只是個......感染者。我不需要你們期望任何東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
